1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,500
The cost to verify.

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:08,267
A model can draft a literature review in forty seconds.

3
00:00:08,267 --> 00:00:15,733
Checking that the papers exist, and say what the review claims, still takes a skilled person hours.

4
00:00:15,733 --> 00:00:24,767
Better models make claiming cheaper. Checking costs what it always cost. The gap between the two is review debt.

5
00:00:24,767 --> 00:00:33,033
Somebody always pays that debt. Left unchecked, it lands on whoever has the least power to refuse it.

6
00:00:33,033 --> 00:00:41,667
The gap closes only from the checking side: make the check cheap to rerun. This video ships with its own receipt.
